WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:02.995
(bright music)

00:00:13.158 --> 00:00:18.075
(Father Nellos speaks in foreign language)

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.430
- [Narrator] On a Greek
peninsula sits Mount Athos,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:47.740
one of the most important centers

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:50.080
of the Christian Orthodox world.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.730
Isolated and autonomous,
monks first arrived

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.870
in the ninth century, and it is a place

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.363
where time has stood still.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.880
Access is very limited, and the location

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.180
is hard to get to, especially
on the Southern side

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:06.543
where cabins sit on cliffs,
a hundred feet above the sea.

00:01:06.543 --> 00:01:10.290
(enchanting string music)

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:15.207
(Father Nellos speaks in foreign language)

00:01:39.449 --> 00:01:43.310
(upbeat string music)

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.650
A monk's life on Mount Athos

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.920
is almost exclusively dedicated to prayer.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.410
Beyond that, life is rooted
in self-sustainability.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.440
Monks grow their own
fruits and vegetables,

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.220
make their own wine, and
do any required handy work.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.904
(upbeat string music)

00:01:58.904 --> 00:02:03.821
(Father Nellos speaks in foreign language)

00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:25.340
(bright guitar music)

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:28.420
Mount Athos remains a holy site

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.870
where numbers of visitors
and prospective monks

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.763
continues to rise every year.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.200
(bright guitar music)

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.340
To some outsiders, the
simple communal life

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.830
may seem archaic, but for the monks,

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.833
it is a peaceful existence
with no distractions.

00:02:45.997 --> 00:02:50.914
(Father Nellos speaks in foreign language)

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:56.827
(bright guitar music)

